On errorActive, on errorPassive, on warningLimit, or on busOff.
o These event procedures are called during a state transition or in response to a change in the CAN
controller’s error counter.
o These are useful to monitor the error counter, to terminate measurements if necessary, or to
execute a reset after a transition to the Bus-Off state.
o The CAN controller’s error counter can be accessed using the key word this.errorCountTX or
this.errorCountRX.
{
