CAPL syntax is based on the C programming language. The following expressions are permitted as
they are in C:
o Instruction blocks: {…}
o If (condition) {…}
o If (condition){…} else {…}
o Switch, case, default
o For …, while …, do … while loops
o Continue and break
o Return
Expressions in CAPLCAPL

{
byte byte_0;
byte_0 = this.byte(0);
…
